#   onnxruntime 1.23.2 has no CUDA provider.
# Harness: .validation/ep-session.cpp, built with MSVC 14.50 (VS 18 BuildTools):
#   cl /std:c++17 /EHsc /O2 /I<ort>/include ep-session.cpp /link /LIBPATH:<ort>/lib onnxruntime.lib
